{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/260262-are-pacts-applied-retroactively","id":260262,"title":"Are Pacts applied retroactively?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-18T19:21:59-07:00","id":260262,"title":"Are Pacts applied retroactively?","content":"So say my character's Cover went to community college, but he wants to improve his social standing. He pacts with a guy for his Harvard Education. Because this has been a significant part of his life, it's a nice chunk of Cover. He gets the Cover and takes it.<br /> <br /> He's told the guys he worked with that he went to Community College before. By applying the Pact to this Cover, does that retroactively make it so that the Cover went to Harvard, and his references have been edited? Or does he have to somehow explain why he was talking about community college when he went to Harvard?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T20:30:43-07:00","id":260289,"title":"","content":"Why couldn't he have gone to both?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T20:32:19-07:00","id":260291,"title":"","content":"There are community colleges that have programs with schools like Harvard and MIT, nothing preventing the cover from going to both. Community colleges generally have 2 year programs, Universities 4 years and up depending on the degree. Associates, Bachelor's, Master's and Doctorate would be the progression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T20:48:07-07:00","id":260312,"title":"","content":"I was just using that as an example. Basically, I'm wondering if it's just a new detail he introduces into his life to the people around him, or if by virtue of committing to the pact, he has always gone to Harvard. Like, how much of reality is being edited when you integrate the Pact into your Cover?<br /> <br /> As another example, I pact a guy for his wife and integrate it into my Cover. Have we retroactively always been married, and her life/my covers has been retroactively edited to suit that narrative? Or do I have to make up a story about a quick divorce and remarriage that I have to explain to everyone around me?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-18T21:03:14-07:00","id":260315,"title":"","content":"Pacts effect those directly impacted by them. It would make sense for a boss who hired an employee to be considered as direct enough since education listed on the resume would effect his decision... his wife not so much (so what if he complained to her about a community collage kid and now praises this same kid but now he's a harvard graduate)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T07:06:12-07:00","id":261238,"title":"","content":"Interestingly, to expand on Mr.F.I.X's point, your example is actually brought up in the Pact chapter of Demon: The Descent. A man gives the demon his wife. His wife is now the demon's wife. The demon's wife believes herself to have always been married to the demon. This is where the demon has to be careful. Her family, unless they live with her or are very directly related to her day-to-day life, do not get &quot;updated&quot;. They still think she's married to the man. This is one primary cause for mortal investigation into a demon's cover (and I imagine a big way both Hunters and Destroyer angels discover demons).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T09:25:30-07:00","id":261290,"title":"","content":"But what about photos? Imagine the rest of the people who got invited years ago to that wedding and now has a photo with a completely different husband? What happens then?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-20T11:39:45-07:00","id":261374,"title":"","content":"Only those in line with direct effect would I say would have possessions influenced. Because if their photo albums were altered why weren't they? Conflicting realities is why a demon must be careful. If they don't plan such activities ahead the ripple will potentially alert the machine. When you are hiding from reality you have to worry about the bane of paradox you actions can cause like a mage but a mage doesn't have to worry about angels coming down on them (unless it is part of the plan)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-21T07:38:05-07:00","id":262152,"title":"","content":"I'd say the photo doesn't get altered. The dissonance would occur not in them realising the photo has changed, but that the demon is not the man in the photo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}